  <item><title>Ruth wearing a winter uniform</title><guid>https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/scl/fi/ac8myub0zejw57nzj97wn/xEhDXKGcgR_2026-Sep-05.webp?rlkey=3qpwa5tt5yt3d30a84lj5c5xz&amp;raw=1</guid><link>https://kiwimeowo.neocities.org/art/2026.html</link><description><![CDATA[<img src="https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/scl/fi/ac8myub0zejw57nzj97wn/xEhDXKGcgR_2026-Sep-05.webp?rlkey=3qpwa5tt5yt3d30a84lj5c5xz&amp;raw=1"><p>Bakatako prompt: Your Favourite Season; Did the prompt again for the Encore quest. Currently, autumn is my favourite season, not too hot, not too cold. What I love about it is when autumn barely has started, the cool breeze and gentle sunlight feels especially good. Shame that lasts very short, and winter immediately beats you up. Also here's Ruth wearing a winter uniform. <span class='blogdate'>(5 Sep 2026)</span></p>]]></description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 04:24:19 GMT</pubDate></item>
  <item><title>Claire and Grey playing Wii</title><guid>https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/scl/fi/iuugizsfdsbjvzm1qsuz0/mJkk6oh5sI_2026-Sep-05.webp?rlkey=7qwrvz3988qitnxy6im0wz7sx&amp;raw=1</guid><link>https://kiwimeowo.neocities.org/art/2026.html</link><description><![CDATA[<img src="https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/scl/fi/iuugizsfdsbjvzm1qsuz0/mJkk6oh5sI_2026-Sep-05.webp?rlkey=7qwrvz3988qitnxy6im0wz7sx&amp;raw=1"><p>Bakatako prompt: Your Favourite Season; Summer used to be my favourite season because of summer holiday, two whole months of non-school! But since I'm not a student anymore, summer is now is just the hot as fuck season to me. Playing Wii with my cousins is one of my favourite summer memories, so I drew Claire and Grey playing Wii together. Not sure what they are playing, but from their expression, Grey probably friendly-attacked Claire <span class='blogdate'>(5 Sep 2026)</span></p>]]></description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 04:24:30 GMT</pubDate></item>
